WEBVTT

00:14:59.329 --> 00:15:01.819
They gave me a legacy,

00:15:01.819 --> 00:15:05.181
and with that legacy comes a responsibility,

00:15:05.181 --> 00:15:07.597
and I am dedicated

00:15:07.597 --> 00:15:09.586
to making my country

00:15:09.586 --> 00:15:12.790
an even better America,

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.000
to making our government

00:15:15.000 --> 00:15:18.497
an even truer democracy,

00:15:18.497 --> 00:15:22.237
and because of the heroes that I have

00:15:22.237 --> 00:15:25.859
and the struggles that we've gone through,

00:15:25.859 --> 00:15:27.858
I can stand before you

00:15:27.858 --> 00:15:30.717
as a gay Japanese-American,